{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beatfinder is a fast and easy to learn rhythm runner with tons of action, magic and parkour!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of one of the fantastic warriors and defeat numerous enemies to the beat of the music. Run through hand-drawn landscapes, from sunset-lit rooftops to glowing crystal caverns, and don't let the obstacles throw off your groove! <br>  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/fe179ea52a491252a2148e67f8a747db.poster.avif?t=1761329933\" width=1170 height=195 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/fe179ea52a491252a2148e67f8a747db.webm?t=1761329933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Strike in rhythm and time your kicks to break through hordes of evil cultists and their magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/ed4d488463046ea821188d32a501e4d9.poster.avif?t=1761329933\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/ed4d488463046ea821188d32a501e4d9.webm?t=1761329933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/ed4d488463046ea821188d32a501e4d9.mp4?t=1761329933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/caacff453fd46d9eba8830f85d43e403.poster.avif?t=1761329933\" width=1170 height=195 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/caacff453fd46d9eba8830f85d43e403.webm?t=1761329933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>The world of Beatfinder is a dangerous place.<strong> </strong>Leap across gaps, slide under lamps, and tiptoe over spikes. Stay on the beat to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/c6763c4956d8fd2e3e3968d49168618e.poster.avif?t=1761329933\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/c6763c4956d8fd2e3e3968d49168618e.webm?t=1761329933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/c6763c4956d8fd2e3e3968d49168618e.mp4?t=1761329933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/d2bbfd6f7f631434e92cbdbb1fd81438.poster.avif?t=1761329933\" width=1170 height=195 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/d2bbfd6f7f631434e92cbdbb1fd81438.webm?t=1761329933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Immerse yourself and jam to our original electronic folk soundtrack, enhanced by vibrant visual effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/522bc48a189cd1caeb3df50387d9a3da.poster.avif?t=1761329933\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/522bc48a189cd1caeb3df50387d9a3da.webm?t=1761329933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/522bc48a189cd1caeb3df50387d9a3da.mp4?t=1761329933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/4758aef3bb50b47f623e35bd57d6eaf9.poster.avif?t=1761329933\" width=1170 height=195 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/4758aef3bb50b47f623e35bd57d6eaf9.webm?t=1761329933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Tackle handcrafted tracks across multiple difficulty levels and test your hand-eye coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/314dc66e7398db95f19ef472f442354e.poster.avif?t=1761329933\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/314dc66e7398db95f19ef472f442354e.webm?t=1761329933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/314dc66e7398db95f19ef472f442354e.mp4?t=1761329933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/93e46cd685d6ca7454bb6107a4c6e90f.poster.avif?t=1761329933\" width=1170 height=195 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/93e46cd685d6ca7454bb6107a4c6e90f.webm?t=1761329933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Seriously, that\u2019s all it takes to play Beatfinder! Focus on the rhythm and let the action flow with our simple controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/09ded93afeea496f25eefeb0f2d6c462.poster.avif?t=1761329933\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/09ded93afeea496f25eefeb0f2d6c462.webm?t=1761329933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/09ded93afeea496f25eefeb0f2d6c462.mp4?t=1761329933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic music system</strong> \u2013 The higher the streak, the richer the soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-game level editor</strong> \u2013 Create custom levels and effects for your favourite tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable content</strong> \u2013 Multiple unique hand-drawn characters and backgrounds to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Workshop support</strong> \u2013 Share and download content made by the community.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 Compete with other players and beat the high score.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymou