s/fe179ea52a491252a2148e67f8a747db.webm?t=1761329933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Strike in rhythm and time your kicks to break through hordes of evil cultists and their magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/ed4d488463046ea821188d32a501e4d9.poster.avif?t=1761329933\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/ed4d488463046ea821188d32a501e4d9.webm?t=1761329933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/ed4d488463046ea821188d32a501e4d9.mp4?t=1761329933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/caacff453fd46d9eba8830f85d43e403.poster.avif?t=1761329933\" width=1170 height=195 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/caacff453fd46d9eba8830f85d43e403.webm?t=1761329933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>The world of Beatfinder is a dangerous place.<strong> </strong>Leap across gaps, slide under lamps, and tiptoe over spikes. Stay on the beat to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/c6763c4956d8fd2e3e3968d49168618e.poster.avif?t=1761329933\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/c6763c4956d8fd2e3e3968d49168618e.webm?t=17613