/apps/3537980/extras/4758aef3bb50b47f623e35bd57d6eaf9.webm?t=1761329933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Tackle handcrafted tracks across multiple difficulty levels and test your hand-eye coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/314dc66e7398db95f19ef472f442354e.poster.avif?t=1761329933\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/314dc66e7398db95f19ef472f442354e.webm?t=1761329933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/314dc66e7398db95f19ef472f442354e.mp4?t=1761329933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/93e46cd685d6ca7454bb6107a4c6e90f.poster.avif?t=1761329933\" width=1170 height=195 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/93e46cd685d6ca7454bb6107a4c6e90f.webm?t=1761329933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Seriously, that\u2019s all it takes to play Beatfinder! Focus on the rhythm and let the action flow with our simple controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/09ded93afeea496f25eefeb0f2d6c462.poster.avif?t=1761329933\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537980/extras/09ded93afeea496f25eefeb0f2d6c462.webm?t=1761329933\